### ============================================================
### 1. CREATION D'ACTIVITES - Collectivité 1
### ============================================================

### Activité récurrente : assemblée générale tous les 2ème dimanche du mois
POST http://localhost:8080/collectivities/col-1/activities
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "label": "Assemblée générale mensuelle",
    "activityType": "MEETING",
    "memberOccupationConcerned": [],
    "recurrenceRule": {
      "weekOrdinal": 2,
      "dayOfWeek": "SU"
    }
  }
]

###

### Activité récurrente : formation obligatoire juniors tous les 4ème samedi du mois
POST http://localhost:8080/collectivities/col-1/activities
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "label": "Formation obligatoire juniors",
    "activityType": "TRAINING",
    "memberOccupationConcerned": ["JUNIOR"],
    "recurrenceRule": {
      "weekOrdinal": 4,
      "dayOfWeek": "SA"
    }
  }
]

###

### Activité exceptionnelle à date fixe : formation thématique
POST http://localhost:8080/collectivities/col-1/activities
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "label": "Formation technique riziculture",
    "activityType": "TRAINING",
    "memberOccupationConcerned": [],
    "executiveDate": "2026-06-15"
  }
]

###

### Activité pour membres SENIOR uniquement
POST http://localhost:8080/collectivities/col-1/activities
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "label": "Réunion des membres confirmés",
    "activityType": "OTHER",
    "memberOccupationConcerned": ["SENIOR", "PRESIDENT", "VICE_PRESIDENT", "TREASURER", "SECRETARY"],
    "executiveDate": "2026-07-10"
  }
]

###

### Plusieurs activités en une seule requête pour col-2
POST http://localhost:8080/collectivities/col-2/activities
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "label": "Assemblée générale mensuelle",
    "activityType": "MEETING",
    "memberOccupationConcerned": [],
    "recurrenceRule": {
      "weekOrdinal": 1,
      "dayOfWeek": "SA"
    }
  },
  {
    "label": "Formation pisciculture",
    "activityType": "TRAINING",
    "memberOccupationConcerned": [],
    "executiveDate": "2026-05-20"
  }
]

### ============================================================
### 2. CAS D'ERREUR - Création d'activités
### ============================================================

### Erreur 400 : recurrenceRule ET executiveDate fournis en même temps
POST http://localhost:8080/collectivities/col-1/activities
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "label": "Activité invalide",
    "activityType": "MEETING",
    "memberOccupationConcerned": [],
    "recurrenceRule": {
      "weekOrdinal": 2,
      "dayOfWeek": "SU"
    },
    "executiveDate": "2026-06-15"
  }
]

###

### Erreur 400 : ni recurrenceRule ni executiveDate fournis
POST http://localhost:8080/collectivities/col-1/activities
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "label": "Activité sans date",
    "activityType": "MEETING",
    "memberOccupationConcerned": []
  }
]

###

### Erreur 400 : weekOrdinal invalide (> 5)
POST http://localhost:8080/collectivities/col-1/activities
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "label": "Activité invalide",
    "activityType": "MEETING",
    "memberOccupationConcerned": [],
    "recurrenceRule": {
      "weekOrdinal": 6,
      "dayOfWeek": "MO"
    }
  }
]

###

### Erreur 404 : collectivité inexistante
POST http://localhost:8080/collectivities/col-999/activities
Content-Type: application/json

[
  {
    "label": "Test",
    "activityType": "MEETING",
    "memberOccupationConcerned": [],
    "executiveDate": "2026-06-15"
  }
]

